5
00:01:50,561 --> 00:01:52,111
     MY FIRST GOOD FRIEND.      

6
00:01:52,146 --> 00:01:53,745
           (Miguel)             
      WE NEED TO GO AFTER       
        THE ROOT CAUSE.         

7
00:01:53,781 --> 00:01:57,883
    BLOOD-SUCKING, SOULLESS     
